'''Elementalist [[Shing Jea armor]]''' is an art type available in the Factions campaign as starter armor (named '''Apprentice's armor'''), as [[collector]] armor for the region of [[Shing Jea Island]] and as regular crafted armor.

There is no [[Prestige armor|prestige]] version of Shing Jea armor.

